---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import {articles} from "../../data/articles";
export function getStaticPaths() { return [{params:{post:"the-role-of-robotic-welding-in-modern-fabrication"},props:{post:null}}, ...articles.map(post=>({params:{post:post.slug},props:{post}}))]; }
const {post}=Astro.props;
---
<BaseLayout title={post?.title ?? "The Role of Robotic Welding in Modern Fabrication"} description={post ? `${post.title} — ATA Industries Fabrication Insights. Article content awaiting supply.` : "Explore where robotic welding supports repeatability and where skilled manual welding remains the right choice."}>
<div class="ata" style="background: #fff">
  <Header active="about" />
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <article>
      <header class="wrap" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 40px">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs" style="color: var(--steel-600)"><li><a href="/" style="color: var(--steel-600)">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li><a href="/blog/" style="color: var(--steel-600)">Blog</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li aria-current="page" style="color: var(--ink)">{post?.cat ?? "Emerging Technology"}</li></ol></nav>
        <div style="max-width: 900px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding-top: clamp(32px, 4cqi, 56px)">
          <span class="badge badge-arc" style="align-self: flex-start">{post?.cat ?? "Emerging Technology"}</span>
          <h1 class="disp h1">{post?.title ?? "The Role of Robotic Welding in Modern Fabrication"}</h1>
          <p class="lead">{post ? (post.introduction ?? "[Article introduction]") : "Where a cobot earns its place on the floor, and where an experienced welder still wins."}</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px 24px; padding-top: 8px">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px"><span class="ph" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0; border-radius: 50%"></span><span><b style="display: block; font-size: 15px">[Author name]</b><span class="help">[Role]</span></span></div>
            <span class="mono" style="color: var(--steel-600)">[Date] · [X] min read</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio: 21 / 9; min-height: 240px">[Article hero image · 2400 × 1030]</div></div>

      <div class="wrap" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px clamp(40px, 6cqi, 96px); padding-top: clamp(40px, 5cqi, 72px); padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 8cqi, 120px); align-items: flex-start">
        <div style="flex: 1 1 560px; max-width: 720px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7">
          {post ? <p class="body">[Article content to be supplied]</p> : <Fragment>
          <p class="help" style="font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px">[Sample body showing article formatting — replace with the full post]</p>
          <p style="margin: 0">Welding is where most fabricated parts succeed or fail. A bracket can be cut perfectly and bent to print, then pulled out of square by a weld that runs a little hot. Robotic welding exists to take that variability out of the process.</p>
          <h2 class="disp h3" style="margin-top: 16px">What a robot changes</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0">A robotic arm lays the same bead, at the same speed and angle, on part one and part one thousand. That consistency shows up as tighter tolerances (within ±0.2 mm in some cases) and less rework downstream.</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <li>Repeatable bead size and penetration across a run</li>
            <li>Less distortion from heat input that varies part to part</li>
            <li>Faster cycle times on mid-volume production</li>
          </ul>
          <blockquote style="margin: 16px 0; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink)">
            <p class="disp" style="font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0">“The robot handles repetition. Our welders handle judgment.”</p>
            <footer class="mono" style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--steel-600)">— [Name, role]</footer>
          </blockquote>
          <h2 class="disp h3" style="margin-top: 16px">Where manual welding still wins</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0">Complex weldments, large multi-part structures and short runs often go faster with an AWS-qualified welder than with the time it takes to program and fixture a robot.</p>
          <figure style="margin: 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
            <div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9">[In-article image]</div>
            <figcaption class="help">The Cooper Cobot robotic welder at ATA Industries. [Caption]</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div style="background: var(--paper); border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <p class="mono" style="margin: 0; color: var(--steel-600)">Key takeaway</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 500">Use robotic welding for repeatable, mid-volume work. Keep skilled manual welders for complex and low-volume jobs. A shop with both can match the method to each part.</p>
          </div>
          </Fragment>}
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--steel-200); margin-top: 16px">
            <span class="mono" style="color: var(--steel-600); align-self: center; margin-right: 8px">Tags</span>
            <a class="chip" href="/services/#welding">Welding</a>
            <a class="chip" href="/blog/">Robotics</a>
            <a class="chip" href="/blog/">Quality</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside style="flex: 0 1 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
          <div style="background: var(--mill); color: var(--on-dark); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
            <p class="mono" style="margin: 0; color: var(--arc-on-dark)">Have a weldment to quote?</p>
            <p class="disp h4" style="color: #fff; font-size: 24px">Send your drawings. Pricing in 24–48 hours.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/quote/" style="align-self: flex-start">Request a Quote</a>
          </div>
          <div style="border: 1px solid var(--steel-200); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
            <p class="mono" style="margin: 0; color: var(--steel-600)">Related services</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/services/#welding" style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 15px">Welding <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="/quality/" style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 15px">Quality assurance <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="sec" style="background: var(--paper)">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Keep reading</p>
            <h2 class="disp h2">Related articles</h2>
          </div>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/blog/">All articles <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="g3">
          <a class="card" href="/blog/how-fiber-lasers-outperform-co2-lasers-in-modern-shops/"><div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9">[Article image]</div><div class="card-body"><span class="mono" style="color: var(--steel-600)">{post?.cat ?? "Emerging Technology"} · [Date]</span><h3 class="disp h4">How Fiber Lasers Outperform CO₂ Lasers in Modern Shops</h3><span class="card-cta">Read article <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></span></div></a>
          <a class="card" href="/blog/what-s-the-difference-between-welding-and-fabrication/"><div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9">[Article image]</div><div class="card-body"><span class="mono" style="color: var(--steel-600)">Metal Fabrication · [Date]</span><h3 class="disp h4">What's the Difference Between Welding and Fabrication?</h3><span class="card-cta">Read article <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></span></div></a>
          <a class="card" href="/blog/quality-control-in-metal-fabrication-processes-standards-and-why-it-matters/"><div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9">[Article image]</div><div class="card-body"><span class="mono" style="color: var(--steel-600)">{post?.cat ?? "Emerging Technology"} · [Date]</span><h3 class="disp h4">Quality Control in Metal Fabrication: Processes, Standards and Why It Matters</h3><span class="card-cta">Read article <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></span></div></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</div>
</BaseLayout>
